Z||000005||Monkeyman||09-01-2000||12:03 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88formula:<BR><B>I checked out there web-site... <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Lane/1588/quickcat.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Lane/1588/quickcat.html</A> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That isn't actually their site.  Someone was just kind enough to scan their catalog and make it into a site.  I doubt it's up to date.  I would suggest calling them directly and asking for a newly revised catalog.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 09-01-2000).]||||reg||1
